sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Visitor
    participant W as Web Server
    participant A as Auth
    participant D as Database
    U->>W: GET /home
    activate W
    W->>+A: check token
    A->>+A: verify signature
    A->>D: lookup session
    activate D
    D-->>A: row
    deactivate D
    A-->>-A: ok
    A-->>-W: valid
    W->>W: render page
    W-->>U: 200 OK
    deactivate W
    U-->>W: ack
    U->>U: think about it for a while
